    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Displays important server information in a stylish WordPress admin dashboard widget.</p>\n<p><strong>Server information shown:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Server IP</li>\n<li>Software</li>\n<li>OS / ARCH</li>\n<li>HTTPS</li>\n<li>Opache</li>\n<li>MEM Limit</li>\n<li>PHP version</li>\n<li>SAPI</li>\n<li>Max Exec Time</li>\n<li>Max Input Vars</li>\n<li>WordPress Version</li>\n<li>MYSQL Version</li>\n<li>WP_DEBUG Status</li>\n<li>WP_CACHE Status</li>\n<li>Upload Max</li>\n<li>Post Max Size</li>\n<li>Memory Limit</li>\n<li>Max Exec Time</li>\n<li>Max Input Vars</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP file.</li>\n<li>Go to your WordPress admin dashboard.</li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Plugins &gt; Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the ZIP file.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
